  "review_notes": [
    "Four corrections: the article of הָעֲבָרָה is unrepresented and the indefinite a goes to its noun (rule 15); the article of בֵּית הַמֶּלֶךְ takes the written the (rule 29); the substantival article of הַטּוֹב takes what (rule 41); and the suffix of בְּעֵינָיו takes the subject pronoun he while the preposition and noun go unrepresented (rules 40, 18), leaving thought with the predicate adjective.",
